  "source_sha256": "231bfc6f3eb0e1fb8edd067422b19e00f8d646b00313fc5c40bca691878d706d",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "efffe8bc6a1a8b8529eaf1c669d25ddbae5fd908bafadff62dbf9db24761d17b",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nOne Little Bite",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "77474b157e2326ab901e36f79bd8c626d82e1cba9cb0b29bf893fc9a7e41a268",
      "text": "The sun sank low.\nSun Wukong hugged his peach.\n“Only peaches for me!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "354b47ba11d49ce659cbb32a87b22983202bd8197fcc3449b199d83687ccb263",
      "text": "“Come help with supper,”\nsaid Pigsy.\nWukong washed a carrot.\nSplash! His nose got wet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0bf200ef2fe03c823668884c9316e00e8f6f824c087f84370ec68edb4446593d",
      "text": "Sandy stirred a little pot.\nA leaf fell onto\nWukong’s peach.\n“My peach has a hat!”\nHe gave a little giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b82a3dcd7ca520147a60b79942e7c7221ab12cf42f6af7b4408015d0028fa3f7",
      "text": "A sweet smell filled the air.\n“What is that?”\nasked Wukong.\n“A warm carrot,” said Sandy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b592af927caf23cd340b1f2b16af0ae78b199971c5674766ab1a02967255a386",
      "text": "Wukong took one tiny bite.\n“Oh! Sweet and soft.”\nHe set his peach\nbeside his bowl.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "04507f52b35289df18423d12742c2a8322783ccf03ead74a59886cffe0a8ff13",
      "text": "“How about a little green?”\nWukong tried a small leaf.\n“Hmm… soft and juicy!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27e9794d317e60220b0b08115570c8eb70268018454939579c41b4653c9a97de",
      "text": "He tried rice\nand little tofu cubes.\nA little of this.\nA little of that.\n“My bowl has new friends!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "633f22784dc3509ceea328e7fdb4d0630c6691ac031246761f635c9a82942619",
      "text": "The moon shone over supper.\nWukong ate one last\npeach bite.\n“I like more than peaches.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37d532fdb1314abc853468c1b2ef387e0fdb5dba0ce547ba2867e234b4bd13d2",
      "text": "Wukong snuggled into bed.\n“Goodnight, little bowl.\nGoodnight, friends.”\nTomorrow, he could try\nsomething new.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
